The new universal bus designs (aka Fujiversal), e.g.

* coco-bus
* MSX
* Intellivision

Need a way to flash both the RP2040/2350/2354 and the ESP32S3 devices with a single firmware image, and a single command.

All of these devices will have the UART (CP2102) port on the ESP32S3 exposed to the user to connect to a PC.

A method and sequencing needs to be devised so that the FujiNet flasher at @~/Workspace/fujinet-flasher can be used to send the firmware across, and to flash the appropriate ESP32S3 and pico devices in the correct order. 

Once done, the devices should reset and the ESP32S3 should be visible for monitoring from the same UART port.

The method should be easily extensible to other fujiversal devices that also use this design, and it should not break existing designs that are ESP32 or ESP32S3 only.

